=== Shape A — `::BIT(N)` / `::BIT VARYING(N)` / `::VARBIT(N)` cast (1105, parametric form preserved) ===
SELECT '10110'::BIT(5);
ERROR 1105: execution error: unsupported CAST target type: BIT(5)
SELECT '10110'::BIT VARYING(8);
ERROR 1105: execution error: unsupported CAST target type: BIT VARYING(8)
SELECT '10110'::VARBIT(8);
ERROR 1105: execution error: unsupported CAST target type: VARBIT(8)
=== Shape B — BIT/VARBIT DDL column (1064, parametric form preserved) ===
